    <PackageReleaseNotes>Portamical v5.0.0 - Architectural Extraction &amp; Modularization

Portamical.Converters is now a standalone package, extracted from the shared Portamical module as part of the ecosystem‑wide v5.0.0 refactoring. This release isolates all data‑provider interfaces and collection‑conversion infrastructure into a dedicated, framework‑agnostic component.

Key Changes

Extracted Components
• Data Provider Interfaces
  - ITestDataProvider&lt;TTestData&gt; — manages test‑data collections with method metadata
  - ITestDataConverter&lt;TTestData, TRow&gt; — converts test data into framework‑specific row formats
  - Full variance support (in/out)
• Collection Converters
  - Synchronous: ToDistinctArray&lt;TTestData, TRow&gt;() with identity/ArgsCode/PropsCode wrappers
  - Async Enumerables: ToDistinctAsyncEnumerable&lt;TTestData, TRow&gt;() for streaming conversion
  - Task‑based: ToDistinctArrayTask&lt;TTestData, TRow&gt;() with smart sync/async threshold
  - Data Provider Conversions: ToDataProvider&lt;TProvider, TTestData&gt;()

Architecture Improvements
• Clear separation of concerns:
  - Portamical.Core → Portamical.Converters → Portamical → Framework adapters
• Reusable, pure conversion infrastructure
• No circular dependencies
• Independent versioning and release cadence

Performance Characteristics
• Deduplication: O(n) time, O(n) space
• Sync conversions: ~1–2 µs for small collections
• Task‑based:
• Sync path (&lt;10 items): ~1–3 µs
• Async path (≥10 items): ~6–22 µs
• Async enumeration: O(n) time, O(1) space

Breaking Changes
• Data provider interfaces moved to Portamical.Converters.DataProviders
• Collection converters moved into the new Portamical.Converters package
• Update references from Portamical → Portamical.Converters

Migration
•  Before (Portamica.Converters module
    using Portamical.DataProviders;
    using Portamical.Converters;
• After (v5.0.0)
    using Portamical.Converters.DataProviders;
    using Portamical.Converters;
    using Portamical.Converters.Tasks;
    using Portamical.Converters.AsyncEnumerables;

Compatibility
• Requires Portamical.Core ≥ 4.2.1
• Targets .NET 10.0
• All framework adapters (xUnit, MSTest, NUnit, TUnit) updated to v5.0.0
• No functional changes to deduplication or conversion logic
